{
  "bookId": "hero-213112",
  "id": "bond-28593",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28593001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "辛德瑞拉",
          "text": "抱歉，我不知道你在这里。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28593003",
              "text": "你在找什么东西吗？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28593002",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28593003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "辛德瑞拉",
          "text": "不，只是初到新的环境不太习惯，到这里散散心而已。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28593005",
              "text": "那么，是时候把这只鞋还给你了。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28593004",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28593005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "辛德瑞拉",
          "text": "这……这正是我失落的那只水晶鞋！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28593006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "辛德瑞拉",
          "text": "它对我来说非常重要，我找了很久，始终毫无进展。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28593007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "辛德瑞拉",
          "text": "果然，正如预言中所说，只有「命定之人」才能找到。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28593009",
              "text": "我很荣幸能帮到你。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28593009",
              "text": "记住，你并不孤单。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28593008",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28593009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "辛德瑞拉",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28593010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "辛德瑞拉",
          "text": "原本我早已习惯独自应对所有的事，或许该做出一些改变了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "28593",
